# ---------------------------------------------------------------- people new in era 3
@char e3.tobin
name: Tobin Krall, of the allocation board
speaker: TOBIN
faction: district
about: Thirty-two. Jonah Krall's son. Sits on the allocation board in a suit his father paid for. Remembers everybody's father.

@char e3.oren
name: Oren Tesk, entered Haldane
speaker: OREN
faction: hesh
about: Twenty-four. Dorrah's nephew, town Hesh, a drayman at the far-bank works. Anni's husband four years. Laughs first so nobody else has to.

@char e3.mim
name: Mim Sallis
speaker: MIM
faction: hesh
about: Eight. Davin's daughter. Says the Heshen word for a thing before the Tarn one and gets hit for it.

@char e3.lio
name: Lio Sallis
speaker: LIO
faction: hesh
about: Twenty. Arn's youngest. Marries Tesse Varn under the stairs of the Mott house.

@char e3.tesse
name: Tesse Varn
speaker: TESSE
faction: hesh
about: Nineteen. Sews sacks at the mill. Lisle and Orla Varn's niece.

@char e3.hanne
name: Hanne Sholl
speaker: HANNE
faction: hesh
about: Thirty-five. Goat-Hesh from over the ridge, four children, the back room under the stairs. Town Hesh look down on her and she knows it.

@char e3.tamm
name: Miss Tamm, the teacher
speaker: TAMM
faction: district
about: Twenty-five. Mr Tamm's daughter. Keeps a ruler and a red pencil. Believes every word of the book.

@char e3.hollis
name: Reverend Hollis
speaker: HOLLIS
faction: district
about: Fifty-five. The Furrow Church. Preaches from notes he has used before.

@char e3.pruett
name: Mrs Pruett
speaker: PRUETT
faction: district
about: Fifty. Tarn, a widow at the shift table. Lost her little one in the hard winter. Kind to children in a way that hurts them.

@char e3.lena
name: Lena Ashby, of the Gazette
speaker: LENA
faction: district
about: Thirty-eight. Clement Ashby's daughter. Writes the schoolbook's chapter on the rebuilding.

@char e3.harriet
name: Harriet Orme, the loan office
speaker: HARRIET
faction: district
about: Forty. George's daughter. The far-bank flats are her bank's paper.

@char e3.vesh
name: Mother Vesh
speaker: VESH
faction: hesh
about: Old. Nobody knows how old. Leads the prayer at the Well House because she remembers all of it.

@char e3.voice
name: A voice in the queue
speaker: VOICE
faction: district
about: A man behind you at the low pump, quiet, used to being listened to. You never see his face. You see his hand.

@char e3.rob
name: Rob Haldane
speaker: ROB
faction: district
about: Eleven, in year 46. Aaron's son. Found a blue thread in a drawer.

